; countup.tom
; The sample to run. This is the seminar exercise "count up in fives".
; Press F5. The yellow cell is the line TOM is on. Each line clicks.
; HLT plays the horn. The printer should show 5 10 15 20 25 30 35 40 45 50.
;
; answer starts at 0, count starts at 10, and each pass adds 5 and
; subtracts 1. JM0 leaves the loop when the counter hits zero.

start   LDA answer
        AC+ five
        OUT
        STO answer
        LDA count
        AC- one
        STO count
        JM0 done
        JMP start
done    HLT

        ORG 20
answer  DAT 0
count   DAT 10
five    DAT 5
one     DAT 1
